    - target: {fileID: 6330939485870960099, guid: b9ee498a9645c964e9c1112d4066b70f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '--- System ---

        Preview placeholder for ForceAd debug text.


        ---
        Selected Group ---

        Activates or shows the currently selected target.


        ---
        Notes ---

        1. Uses the same title / notice / button scale as the
        standardized sections.

        2. Keeps a dedicated detail card instead
        of the dense legacy table layout.

        3. Reserves enough height for
        long debug text without making the section too tall.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
