    - target: {fileID: 6330939485870960099, guid: b9ee498a9645c964e9c1112d4066b70f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Summary preview

        AL | AppLaunch | API: AL_InitManually()

        AR
        | AppResume | API: AR_InitManually()

        RW | Rewarded | API: RW_InitManually(),
        RW_Show(pos)

        BN | Banner | API: BN_InitManually(placement), BN_ActivateView(placement), BN_Hide(placement)

        MREC
        | Mrec | API: Mrec_InitManually(), Mrec_ActivateView(), Mrec_Hide() | Utility: Mrec_UpdatePos,
        Mrec_GetSize

        CL | Collap | API: CL_InitManually(), CL_Show(), CL_Hide()

        FA
        | ForceAd | API: FA_InitManually(group), FA_Show(pos) | Utility: FA_StartBreakAd,
        FA_StopBreakAd

        PU | Popup | API: PU_InitManually(group), PU_Show(pos),
        PU_Hide(pos) | Utility: PU_UpdatePos(pos, layout)'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
